Covered: the data files that the authors compiled or derived, namely the
failure dataset and its coding (research_ideas/probes/bridge_limits/results/,
coding/, coverage/, incidents/curation.py as a data record, data/incidents/),
the release histories (data/legit/), the derived CCIP, Wormhole and stake
datasets (data/ccip/, data/wormhole/, data/stake/), the testbed logs
(prototype/testbed/logs/), the prototype snapshots, the hand-compiled tables
(research_ideas/bridge_limits_paper/tex/*.csv) and the generated numbers,
tables and figures.

Not covered: material that third parties publish under their own terms and that
these files quote or transcribe, such as the DefiLlama incident list
(data/incidents/defillama_hacks_20261015.json), short quotations from
post-mortems and articles in the research notes, the tables transcribed from
published papers (coverage/*.csv) and public blockchain records. Their own
terms continue to apply. The code is covered by LICENSE.
